<PageLayout
  title="About David"
  eyebrow="Profile"
  description="Systems Engineer and full-stack developer in Mexico City, focused on practical software and applied AI exploration."
  titleKey="profile.title"
  eyebrowKey="profile.eyebrow"
  descriptionKey="profile.description"
>
  <div class="prose">
    <p data-i18n="profile.intro">
      David Talavera is a Systems Engineer who builds business software with Python, React,
      TypeScript, SQL, and cloud-ready tools. His work combines operational understanding with
      maintainable full-stack delivery.
    </p>

    <h2 data-i18n="profile.focusTitle">Focus areas</h2>
    <p data-i18n="profile.focusBody">
      Business automation, data dashboards, ERP modules, database performance, and software
      architecture. He also explores how applied AI can improve practical development and business
      workflows.
    </p>

    <h2 data-i18n="profile.backgroundTitle">Background</h2>
    <p data-i18n-html="profile.person1">
      <strong>Universidad Tecnológica de México</strong> — Systems Engineering, 2020–2023; recognized
      for the highest academic average.
    </p>
    <p data-i18n-html="profile.person2">
      <strong>Languages</strong> — Native Spanish and B2 English.
    </p>
    <p data-i18n-html="profile.person3">
      <strong>Certifications</strong> — OCI Foundations, terminal and command line, and CCNAv7 networking.
    </p>

    <h2 data-i18n="profile.contactTitle">Location</h2>
    <p data-i18n-html="profile.contactBody">
      Based in Mexico City. Connect through the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
